No virtual image or diffraction pattern computed by this library is validated
on a microscope: agreement with py4DSTEM and recovery of planted cubes are what
is claimed (docs/registration-slice-1.md section 8).


================================================================================
mac4DSTEM (the seed of slice 1)
================================================================================

The cube model (shape, sources, scan tiles, the eager and the tiled paths) and
the virtual-imaging and statistics kernels are extracted from mac4DSTEM at
commit 7448401b: mac4DSTEM/Core/Data/FourDDataSource.swift, FourDArray.swift,
ResidentCube.swift, Core/Analysis/VirtualDetector.swift and
Shaders/VirtualMask.metal, DPStatistics.metal. The app's load views,
calibration, residency policy and display types stay in the app.

